## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.7 Flash (Qwen3.7 Flash)
- **Short description:** Qwen3.7 Flash is Alibaba’s vision-language reasoning model/API tier for multimodal agents, visual coding, search, and computer interaction, with verifiable specs/pricing in provider/catalog APIs but no independently verifiable standardized benchmark numerics found for comparable scoring in this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Hosted/API access (e.g. OpenRouter `qwen/qwen3.7-flash`; models.dev lists `qwen3.7-flash`). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.7-flash`.
- **Release / knowledge:** OpenRouter canonical slug/API metadata indicates `qwen3.7-flash-20260727` (created 2026-07-27 in API metadata). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.7-flash`, `qwen3.7-flash`, `qwen/qwen3.7-flash`, `opencode/qwen-3.7-flash`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens context window reported by OpenRouter API/listing; OpenRouter top provider shows 1,000,000 context / 65,536 max completion, while models.dev API lists 196,608 context / 131,072 output (provider/catalog variance). Local metadata claims 1,000,000 total / 131,072 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and video input; text output (OpenRouter API/models.dev/local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** OpenRouter API shows tiered token pricing (e.g. ~$0.03/$0.13 per 1M in/out base tier with cache read/write pricing and higher rates for larger prompt tiers), while models.dev lists $0.12/$0.48 per 1M in/out; provider/pricing varies by route/tier. Local metadata cites ~$0.03/$0.13 (<=32K input) with cache $0.006.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary/API model. Architecture and parameter count not publicly disclosed.

### Raw benchmarks found

> SECOND-PASS SELF-EXCLUSION (updated): I reviewed OpenRouter search/API data, models.dev API/search, Artificial Analysis searches/pages, Hugging Face/Alibaba Cloud/Qwen searches, and local metadata/prior report. I found verifiable identity/spec/pricing/capability evidence for the exact `qwen/qwen3.7-flash` model in provider/catalog APIs (1M context, multimodal text+image+video input, reasoning/tool support, tiered pricing), but no independently verifiable standardized benchmark numerics suitable for comparable 1–100 scoring were found in accessible sources during this pass. Because benchmark coverage is insufficient and context/pricing fields vary by source, this file remains `.md.excluded` (notes only; scores ignored).

